     "titulo": "Comparatives with evidence",
     "texto": [
      "Common comparatives are **roligere** («quieter»), **travlere** («busier») and **nærmere** («closer»). Give the reason with **fordi**: **Sentrum er travlere fordi det er flere butikker** («The centre is busier because there are more shops»).",
      "To express the most intense option, use forms such as **den roligste gata** («the quietest street»). Base the comparison on services or facts from the text, not on generalisations about the people who live there."
